#: processes/content/hcert-contract-change.bpmn:23
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Amend the requirements within the architecture rules"
msgstr "Modificar los requisitos dentro de las reglas de arquitectura"

#: processes/content/hcert-contract-change.bpmn:24
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Change api/wit or api/cddl, then run wit2kotlin, gen-api-types and, if a logical model moved, fetch-lms and lm-derive. Nothing generated is edited by hand."
